<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Rain in the Rotten City</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Adora's gone missing. Not so surprising given the city of Freiburg is a scab on the sore of the world. A place of broken dreams and broken people. Where angels cry, and love is a dirty word. Where justice gave up long ago.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;What's a girl to do when the dame she's wanted for years vanishes? Every story worth telling is about a dame. About pride. About the fall.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Come walk these dirty streets that even the rain can't wash clean.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Jezmatron</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
